~ room_start
[Elliot]: Hey, Riley! 
[Elliot]: Could I please have your help?
[Riley]: Oh hey, Elliot. What’s wrong?
[Elliot]: My cat got stuck up there, and I can’t get them down.
[Riley]: How did the cat even get up there?
[Riley]: Yeah, of course.
[Riley]: Although I don’t really know how to get up there…
[Elliot]: Don’t you know about (wall-jumping)?
[Riley]: Wall-jumping?
[Elliot]: Yeah! If you (jump) next to a (wall), you can gain some extra height!
[Riley]: Wait, if you know how to wall-jump, why couldn’t you get your cat?
[Elliot]: I’m too short.
[Riley]: I... see.
[Elliot]: Just please help my cat before they hurt themselves!
[Riley]: O-Okay... The cat seems to be doing fine.
